": "865151511043206", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035389_865151514376539_175007382094924936_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6TVfYdXtqCMQ7kNvwGF5x84&_nc_oc=Adqbbg9puSAmrO-4U_61ffi3uLhZISsQbZUeHfVOJGp339cNQQkrj64AMWNxbQzOLFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRaO9Tyc-5bn29uOj8teIB-WoNJGv8c3XAdfEtYTUV5Uw&oe=6AFC6586"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-4.png", "id": "540251453759930", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974568_540251457093263_596185216737678114_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6p9d6rpXqC4Q7kNvwHHTqC1&_nc_oc=AdpnPMagupt2_4zDUePcb6ijv1DqrHnFCVDQuVSk_8eccDbSQa2Bot-rp-MTf1d3PEs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRZXf5EcYayTsRsDOjFgM-5BaTaJVoQ_ZoEQKnPy_mflQ&oe=6AFC87A5"}, {"file_name": "CTH-Screenshot-10.png", "id": "210466391035364", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_210466394368697_3171406121056240819_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ozs6TY9-LaUQ7kNvwEHonsV&_nc_oc=AdpbylyvEseZzGymRYDIFx32sNjclbmFNIvFejHoPnKce5gAlQfAK9Rd9GtpDQr8D_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR8TZ4TrbmktHjGExMvl67_YIri5leo0GoaNyqa9ydD3A&oe=6AFC6D85"}, {"file_name": "Captain ToonHead Screenshot.png", "id": "426672885500768", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_426672888834101_6085981131912280130_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mkDfF2e96XIQ7kNvwGdI3Ks&_nc_oc=AdoZ8G_1-SyHosYQYNJK8KDg43NinG0YYp00AdJHoi60M971OrZRyyou1-xWjvzl1pU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTSp01l4k3ggOIEK6L3hUbOpSieVXFBGl6N9png5Q_2vQ&oe=6AFC7FE4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Oculus-Thumbnail.png", "id": "760441625080166", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974883_760441628413499_3472724892994893008_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tOSR_ZnV1dIQ7kNvwGXzG_e&_nc_oc=AdoWxWUbC0P71WnSIrpCOSMXkMyXfPM87_vD2v3lReE_2O2h_wwcUAR3n2O205uPgv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlo_lJcLJqwcoxeE57WmG8qGSuXGxJDRZ0_jh8n9M18g&oe=6AFC7133"}, "display_name": "Captain ToonHead vs The Punks from Outer Space", "keywords": ["towerdefense", "rts", "narrative", "cartoon", "humor"], "long_description": "\"\u2018Captain Toonhead Might Be The Most Over-The-Top VR Game Ever\"\n- VRScout\n\n\"One of the best tower defense games I have played in VR.\"\n- VRGameFaqs\n\n*An ACTION TOWER DEFENSE*\nYou'll move all over the map, hammering away to upgrade towers, throwing over-powered chanclas recklessly and taking control of your towers to unleash streams of heavy-metal powered hot sauce and shoot electric beams from weaponized pizza at your enemies. \n\n*The hero we got stuck with*\nAfter the squad sent by the World Treaty for Freedom (WTF) got fried in the \"burrito incident\", it falls to Elliott Salazar, the cartoon-obsessed space janitor and only survivor, to save Earth. There\u2019s a new captain onboard: Captain ToonHead! \n\n*Balance action and strategy*\nShooting alone will not defeat the waves of Cyber-C.H.I.C.K.E.N.s and Terra-S.H.A.R.K.s. Combine those PIG\u00f1ata tower bombs with your chancla throws in a very strategic way if you want to save the EnerCubes and defeat Nicholas Voorhees' P.U.N.K. army!", "short_description": "Ever wanted to beat a T-Rex up with a chancla, while building powerful towers that shoot pi\u00f1atas, hot sauce and heat-seeking fireworks? Captain ToonHead is the ACTION TOWER DEFENSE of your cartooniest dreams."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://teravisiongames.com/site/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Teravision Games", "support_website_url": nul